{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a world torn apart by ancient deities, where their struggle for power leaves a lasting mark on the mortal realm. Your mission: defend the land against relentless enemies using the might of magical towers and your own combat prowess.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Epic tale of a divine conflict </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ruling pantheon of new gods must face the chaotic powers of the awakened ancient deities.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A wild mix of <strong>action</strong> and <strong>classic Tower Defense </strong>formula</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game blends the strategic depth of the Tower Defense genre with fast-paced action, letting you both plan your defenses and directly influence the battle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Diverse content and endless replayability</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build powerful combinations of towers, face off against enemies with unique abilities, unleash battle-altering spells, and explore a variety of biomes \u2013 each with their own rules and challenges. No two battles ever feel the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you hold the line against endless hordes and uncover the true nature of the divine conflict?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4069220?t=1759779100","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069220/bb647cd4b4a9d40b1632ea975a9ba173c74d574d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759779100","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069220/9342324d3bc1af039768bdea48900350a22ad569/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759779100","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069220/9342324d3bc1af039768bdea48900350a22ad569/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759779100","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a world torn apart by ancient deities, where their struggle for power leaves a lasting mark on the mortal realm. Your mission: defend the land against relentless enemies using the might of magical towers and your own combat prowess.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Epic tale of a divine conflict </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ruling pantheon of new gods must face the chaotic powers of the awakened ancient deities.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A wild mix of <strong>action</strong> and <strong>classic Tower Defense </strong>formula</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game blends the strategic depth of the Tower Defense genre with fast-paced action, letting you both plan your defenses and directly influence the battle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Diverse content and endless replayability</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build powerful combinations of towers, face off against enemies with unique abilities, unleash battle-altering spells, and explore a variety of biomes \u2013 each with their own rules and challenges. No two battles ever feel the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you hold the line against endless hordes and uncover the true nature of the divine conflict?</p>","developers":["MorDanGames"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069220/bf84b963fae2ff7e032c6b061e086d24eed17a34/header.jpg?t=1759779100","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1"